# public/data/agents.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is regenerated from
# data/agents.json on every build, and keeping it tracked means the deployed
# site can always serve the exact snapshot it was rendered from.

# Raw 8004scan API responses, cached so a rerun refetches nothing. 2,600+ files
# and ~43MB of regenerable data — the pipeline reproduces it from the documented
# queries in data/SUMMARY.md, so it has no business in history.
data/raw/
